Body:
You can now hardcode built in (and any other) agent colors in opencode.json

`"agent": {
    "plan": {
      "color": "#FFA726"
    },
    "build": {
      "color": "#3498DB"
    }
  }
}`

> did u try to disable ai title generation in opencode? opencode/opencode.json
> 
> ```
> "agent": {
>   "title": {
>     "disable": true
>   }
> }
> ```

That didn't work. I think the root cause is this https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode/issues/38787
